01:18:41.687 --> 01:18:45.492
heading south will be unobstructed, they will continue. When the light turns red,

01:18:45.508 --> 01:18:49.090
it will stop the northbound traffic, and then people can egress safely out of

01:18:49.106 --> 01:18:53.090
Campus Drive into an acceleration lane And then merge into the

01:18:53.363 --> 01:18:56.914
2 southbound travel lanes. During this project,

01:18:56.978 --> 01:19:00.754
we also adjusted the scope a little bit because we saw the impacts from Walmart

01:19:01.254 --> 01:19:04.112
were creating issues with this intersection, especially with the highway coming up soon.

01:19:05.011 --> 01:19:08.482
So we're adding a second dedicated right

01:19:08.982 --> 01:19:11.840
turn lane. So we have 2 right turn lanes. We're going to have 2 through

01:19:12.340 --> 01:19:15.873
lanes and 2 left turn lanes. What we were seeing a lot was there's

01:19:16.373 --> 01:19:19.098
currently a right turn lane and a through and a right. And because of all

01:19:19.147 --> 01:19:23.003
