01:19:27.601 --> 01:19:30.782
doing this, every lane has its own dedicated movements. If you can use the pointer,

01:19:30.847 --> 01:19:32.071
that will help us a little bit.

01:19:35.950 --> 01:19:39.516
So now— can you guys hear me okay? So now we have every movement

01:19:40.016 --> 01:19:43.941
has its own 2 lanes. So we have 2 rights, 2 throughs, And 2

01:19:44.053 --> 01:19:47.200
lefts. And before, we had a large median here,

01:19:47.730 --> 01:19:51.921
